1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,720
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,760
=Episode 2=

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,720
(Send Her Down to the Grave with You)

4
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:01,760
I'm Imperial Physician Li Chengyan.

5
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:02,960
(Li Chengyan, Imperial Physician)
Greetings, Your Highness.

6
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,680
Do you know him, Mother?

7
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,640
No. Come along.

8
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:15,880
Your Highness.

9
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:19,240
Back when you and I
held hands under the moon,

10
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:21,280
your memory wasn't this bad.

11
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,120
Now you claim you don't know me?

12
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,600
Physician Li, mind your tongue!

13
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,800
Greetings, Cairen Rong.

14
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,800
This is Physician Li, newly appointed
to the Imperial Hospital.

15
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,320
If he has offended you,

16
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,720
please forgive him.

17
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,440
It's fine.

18
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,240
Let's go.

19
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:42,960
Have you heard?

20
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,960
Cairen Rong is quite the sensation.

21
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:47,000
After years of obscurity,

22
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,960
she was suddenly

23
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,160
rewarded by His Majesty.

24
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,040
Anyone in the inner palace

25
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,880
could win His Majesty's favor
at any moment.

26
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,760
We'd better watch our step

27
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:58,440
and not offend the wrong person.

28
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,480
(Fu Rong.)

29
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,680
(After what you did to me back then,)

30
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:06,680
(I've finally come here, for you.)

31
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,240
Your Highness.

32
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,080
Useless fools!

33
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,120
Help me on this side.

34
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,840
Look carefully!

35
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,840
How pitiful I am!

36
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,280
I got beaten,

37
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,000
and couldn't get out of bed for days.

38
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,040
Now I'm the laughingstock
of the entire harem!

39
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,760
Everyone else has sons,

40
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,280
but I gave birth to a daughter.

41
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:37,000
If I'd borne a prince like the others,

42
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,880
I could've risen with my son.

43
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,720
Then I wouldn't have to scheme

44
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,200
and plot so desperately!

45
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,560
It's all that wretched Fu Rong's fault!

46
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,040
All her fault!

47
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,400
She stole our reward!

48
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,920
I'll tear her skin off!

49
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,320
I'll make her wish she were dead!

50
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,560
Watch your step!

51
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,320
Why summon me so urgently tonight

52
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,080
to the imperial garden,

53
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,800
Your Highness?

54
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,800
I risked entering the inner palace

55
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,800
(Prince Su)
because I have urgent business with you.

56
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:35,840
The second Prince cannot wait.

57
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,520
So, Your Highness,

58
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,880
what do you say?

59
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,160
You two, come here.

60
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,920
Come on. Let's try.

61
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,120
Three.

62
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,200
Two.

63
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,000
One.

64
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,080
Let go.

65
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,920
Look, it's flying!

66
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,560
So high!

67
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,800
Mother.

68
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:47,880
I want to send this wish lantern
way up high

69
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:51,400
to pray for your safety and happiness.

70
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:58,160
And I pray you stay happy forever.

71
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,640
Look, so high.

72
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,840
Let's make a wish.

73
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,960
Look, how pretty the lantern is!

74
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,760
What's going on?

75
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,160
Forgive us, Your Highness.

76
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:27,840
Forgive us, Your Highness!

77
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:28,280
Forgive us, Your Highness!

78
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:28,840
We deserve death!

79
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:29,160
We deserve death!

80
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,640
We'll go look!

81
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:30,440
We'll go look!

82
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:31,920
Mother.

83
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:34,880
This longevity lock is from Father.

84
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,480
I can't lose Father's gift!

85
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:40,000
All right, don't worry.

86
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,440
I'll find it. Don't worry.

87
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,120
Watch the princess.

88
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,080
Yes.

89
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,200
It hurts.

90
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,240
Princess, my leg hurts so much.

91
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,600
Could you help me over

92
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,120
to that stone bench?

93
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:27,960
Lingxi.

94
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:30,560
I found it.

95
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:32,000
Look.

96
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,280
Lingxi.

97
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:39,920
Lingxi!

98
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,720
Lingxi!

99
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,400
Lingxi!

100
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:13,920
Who's there?

101
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,840
Have you seen Princess Lingxi?

102
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:20,680
No.

103
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,000
Lingxi!

104
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,000
Lingxi!

105
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:26,360
Did you see Princess Lingxi
on your way here?

106
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,360
Lingxi!

107
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,560
Lingxi!

108
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:31,840
Where are you?

109
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:33,760
Lingxi!

110
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,720
Lingxi!

111
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,080
Lingxi!

112
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,680
Lingxi!

113
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,520
Lingxi!

114
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,600
Come out, Lingxi!

115
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,920
Lingxi!

116
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:48,760
Lingxi!

117
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,080
Lingxi!

118
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,160
Lingxi!

119
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,600
Lingxi!

120
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,680
Have you seen Princess Lingxi?

121
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,840
Have you seen Princess Lingxi?

122
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:20,640
No, Your Highness.

123
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,960
Lingxi!

124
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:24,800
Wait...

125
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,880
Have you seen Princess Lingxi?

126
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,280
No, I haven't.

127
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:37,200
Greetings, Noble Consort.

128
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:39,800
Have you seen Princess Lingxi, Your Highness?

129
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,040
Running around the palace at night.

130
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,560
What a disgrace!

131
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,680
Forgive me for disturbing you.

132
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,240
Please forgive me.

133
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,040
Lingxi!

134
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:04,400
My daughter.

135
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,360
Lingxi!

136
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,520
Lingxi!

137
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:09,560
Where are you?

138
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,200
Lingxi!

139
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,160
Poor Princess Lingxi.

140
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:16,000
She fell from such a great height.

141
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,880
She just got a title.

142
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,160
Seems she wasn't meant for fortune.

143
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:19,960
Right.

144
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,200
She just got her title.

145
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,280
What a pity.

146
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,520
Lingxi.

147
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,440
Move along.

148
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,880
My daughter! Wake up!

149
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:05,120
I'm here.

150
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,560
Wake up.

151
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,480
Look at me.

152
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,560
Look at me!

153
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,000
My daughter.

154
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:42,280
I'm here.

155
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:46,160
Please look at me, Lingxi.

156
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,520
Look at me.

157
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,440
Mother, what's this?

158
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:17,040
The palace is full of deceit.

159
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,520
Young princes and princesses

160
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:21,640
are often pawns in the fight for power.

161
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,840
I've sewn this flower onto your sleeve.

162
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:27,080
It tears off easily.

163
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,120
If someday someone frames you,

164
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:31,680
pull it off to send me a signal.

165
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,840
I'll know you've been wronged,

166
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:36,280
and I will stand up for you.

167
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,160
(I hope my child)

168
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,880
(never has to use this signal.)

169
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:49,080
(Someone murdered Lingxi.)

170
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,840
(Wants to outshine my Jinxuan?)

171
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,120
(Dream on!)

172
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,280
(A South Sea pearl...)

173
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:19,040
(So it was you, Zhaoyi Shen.)

174
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:22,840
(You did this to a child!)

175
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:03,440
(Don't be afraid, Lingxi.)

176
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,920
(Mother is here.)

177
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:07,240
(The road to death is cold.)

178
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:09,880
(Mother will keep you warm.)

179
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:12,000
(Take your time, my child.)

180
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:15,240
(I will get justice for you.)

181
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,960
(Then I'll be there with you.)

182
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,880
(Watch closely.)

183
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:23,440
(Watch how I tear her limb from limb,)

184
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,840
(and grind her bones to dust.)

185
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,120
(I will definitely)

186
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,960
(send her down to the grave with you.)

187
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:38,880
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

188
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:43,920
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

189
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:48,720
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

190
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:53,560
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

191
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:58,320
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

192
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:03,360
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

193
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:08,160
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

194
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:13,120
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

195
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:17,880
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

196
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:21,320
♪Let the stars and sea♪

197
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:22,820
(Changsheng Gate)

198
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:26,640
♪wait for your return♪
